# --- Keep the CMake project files in the repo so a fresh clone builds from the
#     command line (overrides the MPLAB ignore rules above). Note: the generated
#     toolchain.cmake hardcodes the absolute XC8 path of this machine. ---
!cmake/**/.generated/*
!cmake/**/CMakeLists.txt
!cmake/**/CMakePresets.json